        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86069, Lost Wax Bronze Tuscany Twist Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Twist Lost Wax Door Handle is available in either flat black or medium bronze finishes. The 8\" center to center Lost Wax Bronze Tuscany Twist Door Pull is easy to install and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/twist-lost-wax-bronze-back-to-back-pulls-pair-emtek-btb-86069\"><b>Twist Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Tuscany Twist Lost Wax Cast Bronze Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Lost Wax Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86069:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86169:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
